   "algorithm": "SLH-DSA-SHA2-192s",
   "binding_anchor_time": 1785423299,
   "note": "The live production KYA-L4 baseline binding. Baseline => governs from its effective activation boundary B (its own anchor); an artifact anchored before B is pre_baseline (admitted classical-only, resolved=null, NOT governed). Chain length one; the enforcer resolves it from the chain regardless."
  }
 ],
